File Name: public_layout.dart

1. Modification Done:

   * Header and drawer now react to login state: show Dashboard instead of Sign in when member is logged in.
   * MY KMC link goes to `/dashboard` when signed in, otherwise to `/auth`.
   * Shows Admin link in drawer when user has admin access.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Public shell must stay correct after Phase 2 auth so members do not see misleading Sign in links.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Listens to `auth_session.dart` and `role_helpers.dart`; wraps all public and auth pages.

